{"chapter": "criteria", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05XM", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{X}' \\ar[r]_G \\ar[d]_{F'} & \\mathcal{X} \\ar[d]^F \\\\\n\\mathcal{Y}' \\ar[r]^H & \\mathcal{Y}\n}\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$2$", "MATH_0005": "$\\gamma : H \\circ F' \\to F \\circ G$", "MATH_0006": "$1$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}'/\\mathcal{Y}') \\to\n\\mathcal{H}_d(\\mathcal{X}/\\mathcal{Y})$", "MATH_0008": "$1$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{examples-stacks-equation-diagram-hilbert-d-stack}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-map-hilbert}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:55a0331fbe01993a750a995f47b45dfa4d70831be45471010d19fe694efb7b42", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f2605934f905fc88403bbfcec48cceb63056276ea34e0bac14705cdb2c0068db", "source_text": "Consider a <MATH_0001>-commutative diagram\n<MATH_0002>\nof stacks in groupoids over <MATH_0003> with a given\n<MATH_0004>-isomorphism <MATH_0005>. In this situation we\nobtain a canonical <MATH_0006>-morphism\n<MATH_0007>.\nThis morphism is compatible with the forgetful <MATH_0008>-morphisms of\nExamples of Stacks,\nEquation (<REF_0001>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0eb9e659131bc8caab63b844f781a84134ad762e6331bfc78b89309f95cb2b00", "unit_id": "tag:05XN:statement"}
